OL,3,GNEWSAAlmost 50 arrests in operation
OL,4,Atargeting cross-border people smugglers
OL,5,
OL,6,FImmigration Enforcement has made 49
OL,7,Farrests across three days of targeted
OL,8,Faction in a crackdown on criminal gangs
OL,9,Fillegally smuggling people from the
OL,10,FRepublic of Ireland to the UK.
OL,12,FThe arrests are part of Operation
OL,13,FComby, a multi-agency crackdown, which
OL,14,Faims to stamp out abuse of the Common
OL,15,FTravel Area (CTA) between Ireland and
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,18,FThe United Kingdom and Ireland are part
OL,19,Fof the CTA, which allows citizens of
OL,20,Fboth countries to travel between them
OL,21,Fwithout a passport as a legal
OL,22,Frequirement.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
