OL,4,Atargeting cross-border people smugglers
OL,5,
OL,6,FBetween September 22 and 24, law
OL,7,Fenforcement agencies patrolled a number
OL,8,Fof ports, roads and rail networksb@/
OL,9,Facrossb@/Northern Ireland, Scotland,
OL,10,FEngland and Walesb@/in a bid to catch
OL,11,Fthose circumventing UK immigration
OL,12,Flaws.
